                    clear distinction. Reviewed datasets (curated,
                    quality-checked) give full access to analysis tools.
                    Unreviewed datasets open up for exploration, with
                    transparent labeling so users understand what they're
                    working with. No hidden data, no false equivalence.
                  </p>
                  <p class="fr">
